[[Image:Azurelode Mine.jpg|thumb|300px|Azurelode Mine.]]
The '''Azurelode Mine''' is an [[Alliance]]-controlled mine in southwestern [[Hillsbrad Foothills]], south of the [[Hillsbrad Fields]] and west of [[Southshore]]. It is a home to miners under [[Foreman Bonds]] from [[Hillsbrad Fields]],<ref>[[Hillsbrad Town Registry]]</ref> and has guards to protect the miners. It supplies iron to Alliance armories.<ref>{{Horde}} [28] [[Battle of Hillsbrad (5)]]</ref>

The [[Horde]] has three quests which send them inside the mine:
* {{Horde}} [28] [[Battle of Hillsbrad (5)]]
* {{Horde}} [28] [[Dangerous! (quest)]]
* {{Horde}} [30] [[Brutal Armor]]

