[[File:Baggoth's Wall.png|thumb|300px|Baggoth's Wall.]]
'''Baggoth's Wall''' is a dwarven fortification located in the [[Grim Reaches]]. Built by Commander [[Baggoth Ironmantle]], Marshal of Dun Kithas,<ref>[[Historian Sternhand#Quotes]]</ref> it has stood through years of Dragonmaw assaults. However, after years of siege and neglect, it is beginning to fall apart. Cracks run along the battlements, the mortar has crumbled, and a goblin cannonball punched straight through one of the parapets.<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|32|Repairing Baggoth's Wall}}</ref> [[Mountaineer Lightboots]] leads the wall's defenders.

